      ],
      "source": "https://grafton-wi.org/visit-grafton/history/",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Early industry harnessed the Milwaukee River, building dams at the flour mill, chair factory, and lime kiln for hydropower.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
